# Line endings: LF in the repository and in every checkout, on every platform.
# The index has always been LF. Windows checkouts with core.autocrlf=true were
# CRLF, and a tool writing LF lines into one produces the mixed-ending files
# that made scripted edits match in one region of a file and miss another.
# An existing checkout keeps its current endings until a file is re-checked
# out; `git status` stays clean either way.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary data and build products: never touch their bytes.
*.pdf binary
*.rda binary
*.RData binary
*.rds binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gz binary
*.dll binary
*.so binary
*.o binary
